        "description": "Lookback window every increase/rate on this dashboard is computed over. Bot feature counters are far lower-volume than the API's per-route metrics -- most fire a handful of times an hour across the whole fleet -- so Prometheus's ~5m default leaves nearly every series at zero, which makes any ratio a 0/0 NaN and any histogram_quantile NaN too. Widen this if panels still show an em dash; narrow it to chase a short-lived spike.",
